# Commit messages

Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/). `semantic-release` versions from `main`.

| Prefix | npm release |
| --- | --- |
| `fix:` | patch |
| `feat:` | minor |
| `feat!:` / `fix!:` / `BREAKING CHANGE:` | major |
| `docs:`, `chore:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `ci:`, `style:` | none |

Scope with the tracker or layer: `feat(pinia-tracker):`, `fix(layout):`, `docs(state-cookies):`.

```text
feat(state-cookies): track useCookie option metadata
fix(heatmap): keep persistent layout nodes across route reset
```

Do not bump `package.json` or push `v*` tags. Only commit when the user asks.
